  "note": "Re-judged 2026-10-24 (independent auditor, authored none of 9c3697d0d1 or 439a413ffd). RFC 7606 Section 5.4: \"A BGP speaker advertising support for such a typed address family MUST handle routes with unrecognized NLRI types within that address family by discarding them, unless the relevant specification for that address family specifies otherwise.\" The only change to TestRFC7606Section54FiltersWhenTheAttributeWalkIsAbandoned (9c3697d0d1) is its doc comment naming ValidateUpdateRFC7606Peer instead of the deleted ValidateUpdateRFC7606AddPath wrapper, which only forwarded to it with acceptASSet false. Body unchanged: MP_REACH EVPN with a type-2 and a type-99 route, then an AS_PATH header declaring 64 octets with none following, asserts exact TreatAsWithdraw from Session.enforceRFC7606, exactly one synthesized withdrawal, the type-99 bytes absent and the type-2 bytes present. Every other cover and its earlier reading stand. Units ran green at HEAD.",
